{"id":"ba94909a8c6f465a39683c4c732f1325321e39f0","axis":"silent","repo":"supabase/supabase","sha":"ba94909a8c6f465a39683c4c732f1325321e39f0","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"apps/design-system/components/component-preview.tsx","lines":["@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ interface ComponentPreviewProps extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement> {","   wide?: boolean","   hideCode?: boolean","   padded?: boolean","+  squared?: boolean"," }"," "," export function ComponentPreview({","@@ -34,6 +35,7 @@ export function ComponentPreview({","   wide = false,","   hideCode = false,","   padded = true,","+  squared = false,","   ...props"," }: ComponentPreviewProps) {","   const [config] = useConfig()","@@ -93,7 +95,8 @@ export function ComponentPreview({","       <div className={cn('@container mt-4 mb-12', wideClasses)}>","         <div","           className={cn(","-            'relative overflow-hidden rounded-tl-md rounded-tr-md border-t border-l border-r bg-studio'","+            'relative overflow-hidden border-t border-l border-r bg-studio',","+            !squared && 'rounded-tl-md rounded-tr-md'","           )}","         >","           {showGrid && ("],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/design-system/config/docs.ts","lines":["@@ -70,6 +70,11 @@ export const docsConfig: DocsConfig = {","           href: '/docs/ui-patterns/charts',","           items: [],","         },","+        {","+          title: 'Tracing',","+          href: '/docs/ui-patterns/tracing',","+          items: [],","+        },","         {","           title: 'Connect Interstitials',","           href: '/docs/ui-patterns/connect-interstitials',"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/design-system/content/docs/ui-patterns/tracing.mdx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@","+---","+title: Tracing","+description: Composable primitives for distributed-trace views built on the shared design system","+---","+","+```tsx","+import { Trace } from 'ui-patterns/Trace'","+```","+","+`Trace.Root` indexes a list of OpenTelemetry-style spans and shares the result with the parts inside it. `Trace.Waterfall` is the layout container and measures its width so time can be mapped to pixels. `Trace.Ruler` draws the time axis and `Trace.Grid` draws the vertical gridlines below it, and `Trace.Cursor` draws the live cursor. The waterfall has two columns: the tree (`treeWidth`) and the timeline. The children of `Trace.Ruler` render at the right end of the ruler's tree cell, next to the \"Span\" label.","+","+## Waterfall and Ruler","+","+The ruler adapts its ticks to the visible range. While a trace is live (any span has no end), `Trace.Cursor` also draws a line at `nowMs` from the top of the ruler to the bottom of the waterfall, with a dot on the ruler's bottom edge. Pass `nowMs` on the trace to pin it, and `minRangeMs` to keep a minimum visible duration while live.","+","+<ComponentPreview name=\"trace-waterfall-demo\" peekCode wide squared />"],"additions":16,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/design-system/registry/default/example/trace-waterfall-demo.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@","+import { Trace, type Span, type TraceData } from 'ui-patterns/Trace'","+","+function span(","+  id: string,","+  parentId: string | null,","+  name: string,","+  startMs: number,","+  endMs: number | null","+): Span {","+  return {","+    id,","+    parentId,","+    traceId: 'demo',","+    name,","+    startMs,","+    endMs,","+    status: 'ok',","+    attributes: {},","+    events: [],","+  }","+}","+","+const finished: TraceData = {","+  spans: [","+    span('root', null, 'POST /checkout', 0, 480),","+    span('auth', 'root', 'auth.verify', 8, 62),","+    span('db', 'root', 'db.query', 70, 410),","+  ],","+}","+","+const live: TraceData = {","+  nowMs: 1500,","+  spans: [","+    span('root', null, 'GET /export', 0, 1240),","+    span('db', 'root', 'db.query', 100, 900),","+    span('stream', 'root', 'stream.write', 1000, null),","+  ],","+}","+","+export default function TraceWaterfallDemo() {","+  return (","+    <div className=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8\">","+      <Trace.Root trace={finished}>","+        <Trace.Waterfall treeWidth={120}>","+          <Trace.Ruler />","+          <Trace.Grid />","+          <Trace.Cursor />","+          <div className=\"h-24\" />","+        </Trace.Waterfall>","+      </Trace.Root>","+","+      <Trace.Root trace={live} minRangeMs={3000}>","+        <Trace.Waterfall treeWidth={120}>","+          <Trace.Ruler />","+          <Trace.Grid />","+          <Trace.Cursor />","+          <div className=\"h-24\" />","+        </Trace.Waterfall>","+      </Trace.Root>","+    </div>","+  )","+}"],"additions":62,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/design-system/registry/examples.ts","lines":["@@ -1960,4 +1960,9 @@ export const examples: Registry = [","     type: 'components:example',","     files: ['example/status-code-demo.tsx'],","   },","+  {","+    name: 'trace-waterfall-demo',","+    type: 'components:example',","+    files: ['example/trace-waterfall-demo.tsx'],","+  },"," ]"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/package.json","lines":["@@ -803,6 +803,10 @@","       \"import\": \"./src/Trace/Trace.tsx\",","       \"types\": \"./src/Trace/Trace.tsx\"","     },","+    \"./Trace/Waterfall\": {","+      \"import\": \"./src/Trace/Waterfall.tsx\",","+      \"types\": \"./src/Trace/Waterfall.tsx\"","+    },","     \"./Trace\": {","       \"import\": \"./src/Trace/index.ts\",","       \"types\": \"./src/Trace/index.ts\""],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/src/Trace/Waterfall.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,178 @@","+'use client'","+","+import { createContext, use, useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useState } from 'react'","+import type { ComponentProps, CSSProperties } from 'react'","+import { cn } from 'ui'","+","+import { useTrace } from './Trace'","+import type { TimeScale, WaterfallProps } from './types'","+import { createTimeScale } from './utils'","+","+const LIVE_GROWTH_TRANSITION =","+  'transition-[left] duration-300 ease-linear motion-reduce:transition-none'","+","+const WaterfallContext = createContext<TimeScale | null>(null)","+","+function useWaterfallScale(): TimeScale {","+  const value = use(WaterfallContext)","+  if (!value) throw new Error('Trace.Ruler and Trace.Grid must be rendered inside Trace.Waterfall')","+  return value","+}","+","+export function Waterfall({","+  treeWidth = 320,","+  className,","+  style,","+  children,","+  ...props","+}: WaterfallProps) {","+  const { bounds } = useTrace()","+  const [element, setElement] = useState<HTMLDivElement | null>(null)","+  const [width, setWidth] = useState(0)","+  const [height, setHeight] = useState(0)","+  const ref = useCallback((node: HTMLDivElement | null) => setElement(node), [])","+","+  useEffect(() => {","+    if (!element) return","+    const measure = () => {","+      const rect = element.getBoundingClientRect()","+      setWidth(rect.width)","+      setHeight(rect.height)","+    }","+    measure()","+    const observer = new ResizeObserver(measure)","+    observer.observe(element)","+    return () => observer.disconnect()","+  }, [element])","+","+  const [start, end] = bounds","+  const scale = useMemo(","+    () => createTimeScale([start, end], Math.max(0, width - treeWidth)),","+    [start, end, width, treeWidth]","+  )","+","+  return (","+    <WaterfallContext.Provider value={scale}>","+      <div","+        ref={ref}","+        data-trace-waterfall","+        className={cn(","+          'flex min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden bg-surface-100 text-sm text-foreground',","+          className","+        )}","+        style={","+          {","+            '--trace-tree-width': `${treeWidth}px`,","+            '--trace-ruler-height': '28px',","+            '--trace-waterfall-height': `${height}px`,","+            ...style,","+          } as CSSProperties","+        }","+        {...props}","+      >","+        {children}","+      </div>","+    </WaterfallContext.Provider>","+  )","+}","+","+export function Ruler({ className, children, ...props }: ComponentProps<'div'>) {","+  const scale = useWaterfallScale()","+","+  return (","+    <div","+      data-trace-ruler","+      className={cn(","+        'flex h-(--trace-ruler-height) shrink-0 divide-x divide-default border-b border-default bg-surface-200',","+        className","+      )}","+      {...props}","+    >","+      <div","+        data-trace-ruler-label","+        className=\"flex w-(--trace-tree-width) shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-between px-3\"","+      >","+        <span className=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground-muted\">Span</span>","+        <div data-trace-controls className=\"flex shrink-0 flex-nowrap items-center gap-0.5\">","+          {children}","+        </div>","+      </div>","+      <div aria-hidden className=\"relative min-w-0 flex-1 select-none overflow-hidden\">","+        {scale.ticks.map((tick) => (","+          <div","+            key={tick.ms}","+            data-trace-tick","+            className={cn(","+              'absolute inset-y-0',","+              tick.fraction > 0 && 'border-l border-strong',","+              LIVE_GROWTH_TRANSITION","+            )}","+            style={{ left: `${tick.fraction * 100}%` }}","+          >","+            <span className=\"absolute left-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-foreground-muted\">","+              {tick.label}","+            </span>","+          </div>","+        ))}","+      </div>","+    </div>","+  )","+}","+","+export function Grid({ className, ...props }: ComponentProps<'div'>) {","+  const scale = useWaterfallScale()","+","+  return (","+    <div data-trace-grid-anchor className=\"relative z-0 h-0 shrink-0\">","+      <div","+        aria-hidden","+        data-trace-grid","+        className={cn(","+          'pointer-events-none absolute left-(--trace-tree-width) right-0 top-0 h-(--trace-waterfall-height) overflow-hidden',","+          className","+        )}","+        {...props}","+      >","+        {scale.ticks.map((tick) =>","+          tick.fraction > 0 ? (","+            <div","+              key={tick.ms}","+              data-trace-gridline","+              className={cn('absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-muted', LIVE_GROWTH_TRANSITION)}","+              style={{ left: `${tick.fraction * 100}%` }}","+            />","+          ) : null","+        )}","+      </div>","+    </div>","+  )","+}","+","+export function Cursor({ className, ...props }: ComponentProps<'div'>) {","+  const scale = useWaterfallScale()","+  const { isLive, nowMs } = useTrace()","+  const fraction = scale.toFraction(nowMs)","+  if (!isLive || fraction < 0 || fraction > 1) return null","+","+  return (","+    <div data-trace-cursor-anchor className=\"relative z-0 h-0 shrink-0\">","+      <div","+        aria-hidden","+        data-trace-cursor-track","+        className={cn(","+          'pointer-events-none absolute left-(--trace-tree-width) right-0 top-[calc(var(--trace-ruler-height)*-1)] h-(--trace-waterfall-height) overflow-hidden',","+          className","+        )}","+        {...props}","+      >","+        <div","+          data-trace-cursor","+          className={cn('absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-brand', LIVE_GROWTH_TRANSITION)}","+          style={{ left: `${fraction * 100}%` }}","+        >","+          <span className=\"absolute -left-[0.5px] top-(--trace-ruler-height) size-1.5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand\" />","+        </div>","+      </div>","+    </div>","+  )","+}"],"additions":178,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/src/Trace/index.ts","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," import { Root } from './Trace'","+import { Cursor, Grid, Ruler, Waterfall } from './Waterfall'"," ","-export const Trace = { Root }","+export const Trace = { Root, Waterfall, Ruler, Grid, Cursor }"," "," export type {","   RootProps,","@@ -8,7 +9,9 @@ export type {","   SpanEvent,","   SpanStatus,","   TimeScale,","+  TimeTick,","   TimeWindow,","   TraceData,","   TraceIndex,","+  WaterfallProps,"," } from './types'"],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/src/Trace/types.ts","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@","-import type { ReactNode } from 'react'","+import type { ComponentProps, ReactNode } from 'react'"," "," export type SpanStatus = 'ok' | 'error' | 'unset'"," ","@@ -39,10 +39,17 @@ export interface TraceIndex {","   slowestId: string | null"," }"," ","+export interface TimeTick {","+  ms: number","+  fraction: number","+  label: string","+}","+"," export interface TimeScale {","   window: TimeWindow","   width: number","   durationMs: number","+  ticks: readonly TimeTick[]","   toFraction: (ms: number) => number","   toX: (ms: number) => number","   toMs: (x: number) => number","@@ -53,3 +60,7 @@ export interface RootProps {","   minRangeMs?: number","   children?: ReactNode"," }","+","+export interface WaterfallProps extends ComponentProps<'div'> {","+  treeWidth?: number","+}"],"additions":12,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/src/Trace/utils.test.ts","lines":["@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@"," import { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'"," "," import type { Span } from './types'","-import { buildTraceIndex, createTimeScale } from './utils'","+import { buildTraceIndex, createTimeScale, formatMs, niceTickStep } from './utils'"," "," const span = (id: string, startMs: number, endMs: number | null, parentId: string | null = null) =>","   ({","@@ -60,3 +60,44 @@ describe('createTimeScale', () => {","     expect(scale.toMs(100)).toBe(5)","   })"," })","+","+describe('ticks', () => {","+  it('picks the smallest nice step that fits the width', () => {","+    expect(niceTickStep(1000, 10)).toBe(100)","+    expect(niceTickStep(1000, 3)).toBe(500)","+    expect(niceTickStep(7_200_000 * 4, 2)).toBe(14_400_000)","+  })","+","+  it('formats labels with enough precision for the step', () => {","+    expect(formatMs(0, 100)).toBe('0ms')","+    expect(formatMs(0.5, 0.5)).toBe('500µs')","+    expect(formatMs(250, 50)).toBe('250ms')","+    expect(formatMs(1200, 200)).toBe('1.2s')","+    expect(formatMs(2000, 1000)).toBe('2s')","+    expect(formatMs(90_000, 30_000)).toBe('1m 30s')","+    expect(formatMs(5_400_000, 1_800_000)).toBe('1h 30m')","+  })","+","+  it('places ticks as fractions of the window', () => {","+    const { ticks } = createTimeScale([100, 1100], 800)","+    expect(ticks.map((tick) => tick.label)).toEqual([","+      '0ms',","+      '100ms',","+      '200ms',","+      '300ms',","+      '400ms',","+      '500ms',","+      '600ms',","+      '700ms',","+      '800ms',","+      '900ms',","+      '1s',","+    ])","+    expect(ticks[1]).toMatchObject({ ms: 200, fraction: 0.1 })","+  })","+","+  it('has no ticks for an empty window or zero width', () => {","+    expect(createTimeScale([5, 5], 800).ticks).toEqual([])","+    expect(createTimeScale([0, 100], 0).ticks).toEqual([])","+  })","+})"],"additions":42,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ui-patterns/src/Trace/utils.ts","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@","-import type { Span, TimeScale, TimeWindow, TraceIndex } from './types'","+import type { Span, TimeScale, TimeTick, TimeWindow, TraceIndex } from './types'"," "," export function buildTraceIndex(","   spans: readonly Span[],","@@ -69,6 +69,87 @@ export function buildTraceIndex(","   }"," }"," ","+const SECOND = 1000","+const MINUTE = 60 * SECOND","+const HOUR = 60 * MINUTE","+const TARGET_TICK_SPACING = 80","+","+const TICK_STEPS = [","+  0.001,","+  0.002,","+  0.005,","+  0.01,","+  0.02,","+  0.05,","+  0.1,","+  0.2,","+  0.5,","+  1,","+  2,","+  5,","+  10,","+  20,","+  50,","+  100,","+  200,","+  500,","+  SECOND,","+  2 * SECOND,","+  5 * SECOND,","+  10 * SECOND,","+  15 * SECOND,","+  30 * SECOND,","+  MINUTE,","+  2 * MINUTE,","+  5 * MINUTE,","+  10 * MINUTE,","+  15 * MINUTE,","+  30 * MINUTE,","+  HOUR,","+]","+","+export function niceTickStep(durationMs: number, maxTicks: number): number {","+  const raw = durationMs / maxTicks","+  const step = TICK_STEPS.find((candidate) => candidate >= raw)","+  return step ?? Math.ceil(raw / HOUR) * HOUR","+}","+","+function formatScaled(ms: number, unitMs: number, suffix: string, stepMs: number): string {","+  const digits = Math.max(0, -Math.floor(Math.log10(stepMs / unitMs) + 1e-9))","+  return `${Number((ms / unitMs).toFixed(digits))}${suffix}`","+}","+","+export function formatMs(ms: number, stepMs: number): string {","+  if (ms === 0) return '0ms'","+  if (ms < 1) return formatScaled(ms, 0.001, 'µs', stepMs)","+  if (ms < SECOND) return formatScaled(ms, 1, 'ms', stepMs)","+  if (ms < MINUTE) return formatScaled(ms, SECOND, 's', stepMs)","+  if (ms < HOUR) {","+    const minutes = Math.floor(ms / MINUTE)","+    const seconds = Math.round((ms - minutes * MINUTE) / SECOND)","+    return seconds === 0 ? `${minutes}m` : `${minutes}m ${seconds}s`","+  }","+  const hours = Math.floor(ms / HOUR)","+  const minutes = Math.round((ms - hours * HOUR) / MINUTE)","+  return minutes === 0 ? `${hours}h` : `${hours}h ${minutes}m`","+}","+","+function computeTicks([start, end]: TimeWindow, width: number): TimeTick[] {","+  const durationMs = end - start","+  if (!(durationMs > 0) || !(width > 0)) return []","+","+  const stepMs = niceTickStep(durationMs, Math.max(1, Math.floor(width / TARGET_TICK_SPACING)))","+  const ticks: TimeTick[] = []","+  for (let offset = 0; offset <= durationMs + 1e-9; offset += stepMs) {","+    ticks.push({","+      ms: start + offset,","+      fraction: offset / durationMs,","+      label: formatMs(offset, stepMs),","+    })","+  }","+  return ticks","+}","+"," export function createTimeScale(window: TimeWindow, width: number): TimeScale {","   const [start, end] = window","   const durationMs = Math.max(0, end - start)","@@ -77,6 +158,7 @@ export function createTimeScale(window: TimeWindow, width: number): TimeScale {","     window,","     width,","     durationMs,","+    ticks: computeTicks(window, width),","     toFraction,","     toX: (ms) => toFraction(ms) * width,","     toMs: (x) => (width > 0 ? start + (x / width) * durationMs : start),",""],"additions":83,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":415,"deletions":5,"truncated":false,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:06:02.536369+00:00"}